s/13", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1561492, "client_id": 2842477, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/16c46b7c/uploads/origins/ca2b8e17-82e4-42b9-aad4-7f8a1e067a34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c89e559c2ba372e1eb36bc60fe2b10fd", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/16c46b7c/uploads/origins/ca2b8e17-82e4-42b9-aad4-7f8a1e067a34?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3c5b718184faf76cff887c29a10931de", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！あなたのアピールを受け取りました。もしあなたが私の関係を描いてくれたらとても嬉しいです。あなたの絵はとてもゴージャスで、二人の関係をあなたのスタイルで見てみたいわ。\nマイケルは茶髪で紫。ジェレミーは緑に革のジャケット（彼は巻き毛でもあり、参考フォルダに \"Jeremy hairstyle \"として入っている）、キラはスカートに赤い花。彼らはポリアモラスな関係だ。マイケルはちょっと嫌な奴で、無礼で不注意なこともあるが、パートナーのことは深く愛しており、彼らのためなら何でもする。ジェレミーはよく笑い、何事にもユーモアを見出す。キラは彼らにとって太陽のような存在で、パートナーのためなら何でもする。\nマイケルとジェレミーはほぼ同じ身長だが、キラは両者より頭一つ分低い。どちらが真ん中でも関係なく、よく入れ替わる。ローラースケート、ゲームセンターやカーニバルでのデート、星空の下でのドライブ、クラブでのダンスなどを楽しんでいる。どんなデートをするかはあなたにお任せします！:)\nありがとうございました\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-uL9bzSKQQVCJmSNjjBrPD2XbTvfNwmA", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@atelier_roux/works/12", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1f9a701a/uploads/origins/5bd63934-d79c-4f66-b4f0-e9b3fddc6481?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=48f0a751f55a80a75def26611e32c129", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1561492, "client_id": 3124623, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@atelier_roux/works/11", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1561492, "client_id": 2956466, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6e8d70d7/uploads/origins/d6d6e489-f635-4358-944e-9dbeab3825ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7fdba5517202f097b485a2ce0a590d5b", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/6e8d70d7/uploads/origins/d6d6e489-f635-4358-944e-9dbeab3825ba?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=489cd5f6bc8bc1d32351d01fe0d7b15d", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! Thank you for the interest in my character Nera! He is a Assassin that hunts Demons and wears Black and Purple Techwear in a futuristic Cyberpunk city! if possible can you draw him standing in the middle of the city investigating while there are lots of city lights? Thank you for your interest!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18SWBbCTcTIdg7uL0k_h4QRowPQNksLtJ?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18SWBbCTcTIdg7uL0k_h4QRowPQNksLtJ?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@atelier_roux/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1561492, "client_id": 1377136, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/274a8012/uploads/origins/4556c0d2-c84b-49db-8cfa-f2dae6448906?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=078b6925ae79c8350af9f156cf2ec267", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/274a8012/uploads/origins/4556c0d2-c84b-49db-8cfa-f2dae6448906?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8816d2f10993852defa978db81aff654", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! Thank you so much for your appeal and your kind words! I really love the dark themes of your illustrations and I would love for you to draw my original character!\n\nReference: https://sta.sh/2p3ps6mm0to\nI really loved the idea that you had for Laurel and I would love to see your vision!\n\nThank you very much once again for the appeal!", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@atelier_roux/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1561492, "client_id": 0, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/39552443/uploads/origins/e3899a5c-a489-4ac0-b478-763a68da4a5e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4f61092a661879122d3c29282cf82dee", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/39552443/uploads/origins/e3899a5c-a489-4ac0-b478-763a68da4a5e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e50f4bc01a21403e5728b67e9d9e9bde", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello, Dr. Large Curry! We would be happy to work with you if your availability and conditions are suitable.\n\n[Description of Request].\nI would appreciate it if you could draw an illustration of me and my friend's character as a set.\n(I have already obtained permission from my friend.)\nI love both erotic and grotesque, so I have enabled NSFW, but you are free to set the composition and other details as you like.\n\n\nProfile]\n(*You don't have to refer to it, of course.)\n\nAssistant Detective｜Brown-skinned Man: 40 years old.\n40 years old, runs a private detective agency, previously a lawyer. Formerly a lawyer. 176 cm, muscular build.\nHalf Jamaican, half Japanese. Japanese nationality.\nThe reason why he became a lawyer was because he enjoyed the process of arguing, interpreting articles, and connecting evidence to make a case, which was like a sport of thinking.\nI like detective very much as a profession because it is more of a sport of thinking than being a lawyer.\nLaws and regulations change with the times and circumstances, so I have a neutral and moderate character.\nAt best, he is not prejudiced, at worst, he has no interest or attachment.\nHe loves reggae music and calls himself a \"reggae detective. Reggae music is always playing in his office.\n\nAssistant Detective｜Man with long black hair: ? He is 184 cm in height and of normal build.\nHe looks young but has an old man-like personality.\nHe is usually absentminded, but his natural disposition is such that he is easily interested in new things, and he is the type of person who enjoys doing whatever he thinks is fun.\nHe is forgetful and has trouble remembering people's names. (Some part of him dares to do so.) He is also a bit of a forgetful person.\n\nUntil he met the detective, he spent his time in the city, going into universities without permission, listening to classes, and taking a cool bath in the library. He also spent time among the homeless, receiving rations, living in a cardboard house, and living a survival life in the mountains on his own. He looks 21 years old.\n\n\n\nBest regards.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/18hEiGY2Q6zJRigLq9OQ35PdUWN2H6a7j?usp=sharing", "nc": 48, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@atelier_roux/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1561492, "client_id": 2583586, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d6a6c1f1/uploads/origins/d1f8f8be-a3f2-4297-828a-df5a4a28dcbb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=aae16b84e3f36cc8b2353dc5fcc10c41", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": true, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d6a6c1f1/uploads/origins/d1f8f8be-a3f2-4297-828a-df5a4a28dcbb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d91f42bff73f26929fd054a3ffc70688", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello, thank you very much for your appeal! I'm very happy to hear you like my OC!\nI would love to request an illustration of him!\n\nHe is a former warlord from a post-apocalyptic world. He has powers of telekinesis.\nHe is often exhausted and smokes too much for his health.\n\nI have selected NSFW for greater freedom, but please draw him any way you'd like. \nThank you very much!\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/19863284.drew-landon/22446108.outfit-3", "nc": 32, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@atelier_roux/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1561492, "client_id": 1393227, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/aa311aad/uploads/origins/94f3203d-9588-485d-850a-780df88d931b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=417c52be72a800b233a46d1416b5b2a0", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/aa311aad/uploads/origins/94f3203d-9588-485d-850a-780df88d931b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=bd369716495d414ecdbead70e6119461", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello,\n\nThank you for your appeal\nI have seen your art style and what you have drawn and quite like it \nI would to request an illustration from you with the pose and expression left to your own creativity and imagination \nI attached my reference in the link given \nIn case of errors with the link, my reference can also be found in my Twitter \nThank you very much\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/dri